# Upstream-sync conflict automation (docs/upstream-sync.md).
#
# lib/** are build artifacts: the source of truth is src/, and after any
# conflict the whole lib/ tree must be regenerated with `pnpm build`. The
# merge driver below takes the upstream ("theirs") side so the merge can
# finish without markers; the sync script rebuilds afterwards.
lib/** merge=built-artifacts
# The lockfile is owned by the upstream release; after a conflict take the
# upstream file and let `pnpm install` re-resolve local resolution state.
pnpm-lock.yaml merge=lockfile-upstream
